# --- dev/test toolchain (nothing under app/ may import these) ---
# pytest and pytest-asyncio are required by `make test`, and ruff by the lint gate.
# They are listed here rather than only in pyproject's `dev` extra because
# `make setup` installs requirements.lock and nothing else, so a lock regenerated
# without them would silently break `make setup && make test` on a clean clone.
